.TH xil-sfx-lib 1  "xil-sfx-lib " 
.SH NAME
xil\-sfx\-lib \- Discover personally generated Sound Effects from the ElevenLabs account or local SFX/ directory
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBxil\-sfx\-lib\fR [\fB\-\-api\fR] [\fB\-\-local\fR] [\fB\-\-sfx\-dir\fR] [\fB\-\-search\fR] [\fB\-\-all\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-export\-kit\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Discover personally generated Sound Effects from the ElevenLabs account or local SFX/ directory
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-api\fR
Query ElevenLabs /v1/sound\-generation/history (requires sound_generation permission)
.TP
\fB\-\-local\fR
Scan local SFX/ directory only (no API key needed)
.TP
\fB\-\-sfx\-dir\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Local SFX directory to scan (default: <workspace>/SFX/)
.TP
\fB\-\-search\fR \fI<TEXT>\fR
Case\-insensitive substring filter on the prompt/filename
.TP
\fB\-\-all\fR
(API mode) Paginate through the full account history; default: most recent 100
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Print all fields for each record
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Output results as a JSON array
.TP
\fB\-\-export\-kit\fR [\fI<DIR>\fR]
Export SFX inventory JSON + scriptwriter reference doc to DIR (default: current directory)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
